{"2918700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "One more time", "steam_appid": 2918700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PARKOUR / RACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across flying islands on deadly parkours and reach the island first to secure the best loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/b73176923d4c667e4cf38379d8e73299.poster.avif?t=1787303434\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/b73176923d4c667e4cf38379d8e73299.webm?t=1787303434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/b73176923d4c667e4cf38379d8e73299.mp4?t=1787303434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOOT / SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friends are not the only things you have to worry about; hunger and thirst are also a threat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/a3215e00219f47cfac2238a5a4988907.poster.avif?t=1787303434\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/a3215e00219f47cfac2238a5a4988907.webm?t=1787303434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/a3215e00219f47cfac2238a5a4988907.mp4?t=1787303434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT / SABOTAGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each island is a battlefield. Scavenge resources, craft traps, build checkpoints, and equip powerful weapons — from shotguns to sniper rifles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/4b3ef727f39373d784b76756065066a3.poster.avif?t=1787303434\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/4b3ef727f39373d784b76756065066a3.webm?t=1787303434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/4b3ef727f39373d784b76756065066a3.mp4?t=1787303434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVER-CHANGING COURSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same. Procedurally generated tracks create new challenges every time you play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/e1cbacea1f367b4773f6d3b06a1400e7.poster.avif?t=1787303434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/e1cbacea1f367b4773f6d3b06a1400e7.webm?t=1787303434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/e1cbacea1f367b4773f6d3b06a1400e7.mp4?t=1787303434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE ISLANDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every island brings new opportunities and risks. Different environments, different strategies — adapt or fall behind.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/a689841e4bfb2e9b1aef2e72b109c324.avif?t=1787303434\" width=1560 height=777 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLO OR MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or compete with up to 12 players. Outrun them and take them first place.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/0cf3ff0dfbb1ae42036360ecf1b19699.poster.avif?t=1787303434\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/0cf3ff0dfbb1ae42036360ecf1b19699.webm?t=1787303434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/0cf3ff0dfbb1ae42036360ecf1b19699.mp4?t=1787303434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In car and on foot parkours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/b6fb2f0aa4e68a6ace15db8b1b57bcd7.poster.avif?t=1787303434\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/b6fb2f0aa4e68a6ace15db8b1b57bcd7.webm?t=1787303434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918700/extras/b6fb2f0aa4e68a6ace15db8b1b57bcd7.mp4?t=1787303434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP combat with ranged or melee weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting, hunger &amp; thirst systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character &amp; vehicle customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning flying island environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"